        "text": {
            "description_html": "<P><b>Fusion 03, Contemporary South Beach Knob</b></P>\r\n<p>Alone this Fusion made Ball Knob is simple but, when paired with a contemporary style rose, it is transformed into a beautiful and modern design. It is available with 3 different roses choices--all of which exemplify a chicness that is associated with contemporary decor. It will fit 1-1/4\" to 2\" thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Features</b> of the Fusion 03 Ball Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<LI>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</LI>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<P><B>Specifications</B> for South Beach Contemporary Door Knob Fusion 03:\r\n<UL>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<LI>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</LI>\r\n<LI>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</LI>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p><B>When Selecting a Function:</B><ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Dummy Set: Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul></p>",
